        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.33,
          "end": 54.08,
          "en": "so that users from all over the world",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.08,
          "end": 56.55,
          "en": "can visit our application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.55,
          "end": 59.84,
          "en": "Now, therefore, we are going to deploy it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.84,
          "end": 62.16,
          "en": "but before we do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.16,
          "end": 64.62,
          "en": "there is one thing we should also do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.62,
          "end": 67.15,
          "en": "one thing you should double check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.15,
          "end": 70.46000000000001,
          "en": "for any kind of NextJS project you're building",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.46000000000001,
          "end": 73.93,
          "en": "or for any kind of web project in general.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.93,
          "end": 75.56,
          "en": "And that's metadata,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.56,
          "end": 78.78,
          "en": "which you might wanna add to your pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.78,
          "end": 81.59,
          "en": "The content is there on our pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.59,
          "end": 85.07,
          "en": "We do have the content visible on the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.07,
          "end": 87.83,
          "en": "and that's the most important part, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.83,
          "end": 92.41,
          "en": "But at this point, we haven't added any metadata.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.41,
          "end": 95.366,
          "en": "If we inspect the rendered HTML code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.366,
          "end": 99.46000000000001,
          "en": "the head section is relatively empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.46000000000001,
          "end": 101.81,
          "en": "We do have some meta tags here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.81,
          "end": 104.88,
          "en": "but we are missing the description meta tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.88,
          "end": 107.93,
          "en": "which would be important for search engines.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.93,
          "end": 110.72,
          "en": "I'm talking about the description meta tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.72,
          "end": 112.97,
          "en": "which allows you to set descriptions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.97,
          "end": 116.833,
          "en": "which, for example, show up on a Google search here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.27000000000001,
          "end": 120.63,
          "en": "And we're also missing a page title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.63,
          "end": 123.5,
          "en": "which is why here in the tab title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.5,
          "end": 126.72,
          "en": "we only see the address as a title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.72,
          "end": 128.74,
          "en": "And if our pages would show up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.74,
          "end": 130.89,
          "en": "as search results later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.89,
          "end": 133.79,
          "en": "we also want the title like in this case here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.79,
          "end": 136.31,
          "en": "Academind, for my own website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.31,
          "end": 138.38,
          "en": "So setting such meta tags,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.38,
          "end": 140.64,
          "en": "adding such Head elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.64,
          "end": 143.43,
          "en": "that is something we definitely also wanna do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 143.43,
          "end": 144.63,
          "en": "when we build a site",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 144.63,
          "end": 148.03,
          "en": "and that is something which we wanna do here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148.03,
          "end": 151.88,
          "en": "And adding such head elements to our pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 151.88,
          "end": 155.496,
          "en": "is thankfully very simple with NextJS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 155.496,
          "end": 158.3,
          "en": "Let's start on the index.js page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 158.3,
          "end": 160.4,
          "en": "So the HomePage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 160.4,
          "end": 163.61,
          "en": "There we definitely wanna set some title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 163.61,
          "end": 167.46,
          "en": "and we definitely also wanna add a description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.46,
          "end": 172.46,
          "en": "And to do that, we can import a special component offered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.61,
          "end": 177.61,
          "en": "by NextJS, the Head component imported from next/head.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 179.5,
          "end": 183.61,
          "en": "This is a component which allows you to add Head elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 183.61,
          "end": 186.96,
          "en": "to the Head section of your page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.96,
          "end": 188.4,
          "en": "How do you use it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.4,
          "end": 192.29,
          "en": "You simply add it to your returned JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 192.29,
          "end": 194.27,
          "en": "So here next to the MeetupList,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 194.27,
          "end": 198.82,
          "en": "I wanna add the Head element, the Head component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 198.82,
          "end": 202.15,
          "en": "and since adjacent JSX code is not allowed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 202.15,
          "end": 205.41,
          "en": "I will use the React Fragment imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 205.41,
          "end": 209.35,
          "en": "from React, here is the import,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 209.35,
          "end": 211.4,
          "en": "imported from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.4,
          "end": 215.473,
          "en": "I'll use Fragment to wrap Head and MeetupList.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 216.74,
          "end": 220.52,
          "en": "And now inside of these Head tags here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 220.52,
          "end": 224.3,
          "en": "between the opening and closing Head component tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 224.3,
          "end": 228.23,
          "en": "there you can now insert your Head elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 228.23,
          "end": 230.24,
          "en": "So all the HTML elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 230.24,
          "end": 232.23,
          "en": "which you can add in the Head section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 232.23,
          "end": 233.37,
          "en": "you can add them here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 233.37,
          "end": 235.66,
          "en": "Like for example, the title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 235.66,
          "end": 237.65,
          "en": "And then we could give this page a title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 237.65,
          "end": 242.65,
          "en": "of React Meetups, or whatever title we want to have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 243.05,
          "end": 246.98,
          "en": "And actually make sure that this is returned like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 246.98,
          "end": 248.78,
          "en": "If we then save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 248.78,
          "end": 251.76,
          "en": "and we visit our starting page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 251.76,
          "end": 254.06,
          "en": "you will notice that now here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 254.06,
          "end": 259.06,
          "en": "in the tab title, we see that title which I set here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 259.32,
          "end": 262.8,
          "en": "And of course, we also see this in the page source code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 262.8,
          "end": 265.01,
          "en": "There we'll be able to find the title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 265.01,
          "end": 266.233,
          "en": "in the Head section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 267.32,
          "end": 268.253,
          "en": "Here it is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 269.41,
          "end": 271.77,
          "en": "And we also see that if we open the dev tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 271.77,
          "end": 273.92,
          "en": "and inspect the rendered elements here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 273.92,
          "end": 275.703,
          "en": "Here's our title as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 277.36,
          "end": 279.58,
          "en": "So that's how we can add a title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 279.58,
          "end": 283.14,
          "en": "and that's how we can also add this meta tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 283.14,
          "end": 284.68,
          "en": "which holds the description,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 284.68,
          "end": 289.56,
          "en": "which will be picked up by search engines, like Google.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 289.56,
          "end": 294.56,
          "en": "Browse a huge list of highly active React meetups.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 295.90999999999997,
          "end": 299.89,
          "en": "That could be our meta description for this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 299.89,
          "end": 301.22,
          "en": "and that would be the text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 301.22,
          "end": 304.32,
          "en": "which shows up when our page shows up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 304.32,
          "end": 307.973,
          "en": "as a result on a search engine, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 308.84,
          "end": 311.89,
          "en": "So with that added, we now added some meta data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 311.89,
          "end": 314.66,
          "en": "some Head data to this starting page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 314.66,
          "end": 317.1,
          "en": "And we can do this on all the pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 317.1,
          "end": 319.81,
          "en": "On the NewMeetupPage, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 319.81,
          "end": 322.81,
          "en": "I don't just wanna return the NewMeetupForm,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 322.81,
          "end": 325.79,
          "en": "but also add the Fragment here imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 325.79,
          "end": 327.313,
          "en": "from React of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 328.57,
          "end": 331.82,
          "en": "and then between the Fragment opening and closing tags,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 331.82,
          "end": 336.68,
          "en": "have our adjacent JSX code to have the Head section there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 336.68,
          "end": 338.4,
          "en": "and the NewMeetupForm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 338.4,
          "end": 339.94,
          "en": "Head is, of course, a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 339.94,
          "end": 341.779,
          "en": "which we also need to import now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 341.779,
          "end": 346.533,
          "en": "So import Head from next/head like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 348.08,
          "end": 350.92,
          "en": "And now here we can set a title as well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 350.92,
          "end": 354.17,
          "en": "like Add a New Meetup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 354.17,
          "end": 355.82,
          "en": "And we can also update the description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 355.82,
          "end": 360.13,
          "en": "and change this to Add your own meetups.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 360.13,
          "end": 365.093,
          "en": "Create amazing networking opportunities.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 366.46,
          "end": 367.293,
          "en": "Like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 368.49,
          "end": 370.52,
          "en": "So now this is added here as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 371.55,
          "end": 375.11,
          "en": "and hence, if we visit the Add New Meetup page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 375.11,
          "end": 377.04,
          "en": "we see our title here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 377.04,
          "end": 378.61,
          "en": "and of course, in the dev tools,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 378.61,
          "end": 382.53,
          "en": "we also see this description meta tag here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 382.53,
          "end": 383.743,
          "en": "in the Head section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 385.62,
          "end": 386.73,
          "en": "Now, last but not least,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 386.73,
          "end": 388.54,
          "en": "we also want to set a title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 388.54,
          "end": 392.81,
          "en": "and show a description if we view a single meetup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 392.81,
          "end": 394.13,
          "en": "And therefore, we should also go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 394.13,
          "end": 396.57,
          "en": "to this single meetupId page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 396.57,
          "end": 399.63,
          "en": "and also wrap this into a Fragment here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 401.09000000000003,
          "end": 404.40999999999997,
          "en": "and add this Head component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 404.40999999999997,
          "end": 408.063,
          "en": "and bring the MeetupDetail into this Fragment as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 408.99,
          "end": 411.84000000000003,
          "en": "And then, of course, make sure that you import Fragment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 411.84000000000003,
          "end": 416.84000000000003,
          "en": "from React and import Head from next/head, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 418.25,
          "end": 421.63,
          "en": "And then here between the opening and closing Head tags,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 421.63,
          "end": 423.15,
          "en": "we can also add a title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
